IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `snap-core`
IMPORT `snap6-s2036`

-- TESTS for snap6-s2036.l4 (section 2036, Availability of commodities for emergency food assistance program).
-- Every expected value is written here from the text quoted above the assertion, before the module was run.
-- Amounts are dollars; a percentage input is a figure in percent (10 means ten percent).

§ `Tests of section 2036`

§§ `(a)(1) the duty to purchase`
-- src:3113 | (1) In general
-- src:3114 | From amounts made available to carry out this chapter, for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023, the Secretary shall purchase a dollar amount described in paragraph (2) of a variety of nutritious and useful commodities of the types that the Secretary has the authority to acquire through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c of this title and distribute the commodities to States for distribution in accordance with section 7515 of this title.
-- "for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023": both ends in, one year either side out.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary shall purchase commodities in the fiscal year` 2014 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary shall purchase commodities in the fiscal year` 2023 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary shall purchase commodities in the fiscal year` 2013 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary shall purchase commodities in the fiscal year` 2024 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary shall purchase commodities in the fiscal year` 2008 EQUALS NOTHING
-- "nutritious and useful commodities of the types that the Secretary has the authority to acquire".
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the commodity is one the Secretary shall purchase` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the commodity is one the Secretary shall purchase` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(1) the commodity is one the Secretary shall purchase` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(a)(2)(A) to (C) the amounts`
-- src:3117 | (A) for fiscal year 2008, $190,000,000;
-- src:3118 | (B) for fiscal year 2009, $250,000,000;
-- src:3119 | (C) for each of fiscal years 2010 through 2023, the dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (B) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year;
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(A) the amount for fiscal year 2008, in dollars` EQUALS 190000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(B) the amount for fiscal year 2009, in dollars` EQUALS 250000000
-- (C): $250,000,000 adjusted by the percentage: 0 percent leaves it, 10 percent gives 275,000,000, 4 percent 260,000,000.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` 0 EQUALS 250000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` 10 EQUALS 275000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` 4 EQUALS 260000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(C) the amount for a fiscal year from 2010 through 2023, in dollars` 2.5 EQUALS 256250000

§§ `(a)(2)(D) the sums added`
-- src:3121 | (i) for fiscal year 2015, $50,000,000;
-- src:3122 | (ii) for fiscal year 2016, $40,000,000;
-- src:3123 | (iii) for fiscal year 2017, $20,000,000;
-- src:3124 | (iv) for fiscal year 2018, $15,000,000;
-- src:3125 | (v) for fiscal year 2019, $23,000,000;
-- src:3126 | (vi) for fiscal year 2020, $35,000,000;
-- src:3127 | (vii) for fiscal year 2021, $35,000,000;
-- src:3128 | (viii) for fiscal year 2022, $35,000,000; and
-- src:3129 | (ix) for fiscal year 2023, $35,000,000; and
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2015 EQUALS JUST 50000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2016 EQUALS JUST 40000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2017 EQUALS JUST 20000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2018 EQUALS JUST 15000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2019 EQUALS JUST 23000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2020 EQUALS JUST 35000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2021 EQUALS JUST 35000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2022 EQUALS JUST 35000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2023 EQUALS JUST 35000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2014 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the sum added to the (C) amount for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2024 EQUALS NOTHING
-- src:3120 | (D) for each of fiscal years 2015 through 2023, the sum obtained by adding the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (C) and—
-- (D): the (C) amount plus the sum. With 4 percent the (C) amount is 260,000,000.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2015 4 EQUALS JUST 310000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2016 4 EQUALS JUST 300000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2017 4 EQUALS JUST 280000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2018 4 EQUALS JUST 275000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2019 4 EQUALS JUST 283000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2020 4 EQUALS JUST 295000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2023 10 EQUALS JUST 310000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2014 4 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(D) the amount for a fiscal year from 2015 through 2023, in dollars` 2024 4 EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(a)(2)(E) fiscal year 2024 and after`
-- src:3130 | (E) for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (D)(ix) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title to reflect changes between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year.
-- the fiscal year 2023 total is the (C) amount plus 35,000,000: with 10 percent for 2008 to 2022 that is 275,000,000 plus 35,000,000 = 310,000,000.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(E) the amount for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, in dollars` 10 0 EQUALS 310000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(E) the amount for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, in dollars` 10 3 EQUALS 319300000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(E) the amount for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, in dollars` 10 6 EQUALS 328600000
-- with 4 percent for 2008 to 2022 the 2023 total is 260,000,000 plus 35,000,000 = 295,000,000; times 1.03 is 303,850,000.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2)(E) the amount for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, in dollars` 4 3 EQUALS 303850000

§§ `(a)(2) as a whole`
-- src:3115 | (2) Amounts
-- src:3116 | The Secretary shall use to carry out paragraph (1)—
-- src:3117 | (A) for fiscal year 2008, $190,000,000;
-- src:3118 | (B) for fiscal year 2009, $250,000,000;
-- src:3119 | (C) for each of fiscal years 2010 through 2023, the dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (B) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title between June 30, 2008, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year;
-- src:3120 | (D) for each of fiscal years 2015 through 2023, the sum obtained by adding the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (C) and—
-- src:3121 | (i) for fiscal year 2015, $50,000,000;
-- src:3122 | (ii) for fiscal year 2016, $40,000,000;
-- src:3123 | (iii) for fiscal year 2017, $20,000,000;
-- src:3124 | (iv) for fiscal year 2018, $15,000,000;
-- src:3125 | (v) for fiscal year 2019, $23,000,000;
-- src:3126 | (vi) for fiscal year 2020, $35,000,000;
-- src:3127 | (vii) for fiscal year 2021, $35,000,000;
-- src:3128 | (viii) for fiscal year 2022, $35,000,000; and
-- src:3129 | (ix) for fiscal year 2023, $35,000,000; and
-- src:3130 | (E) for fiscal year 2024 and each subsequent fiscal year, the total dollar amount of commodities specified in subparagraph (D)(ix) adjusted by the percentage by which the thrifty food plan has been adjusted under section 2012(u)(3) of this title to reflect changes between June 30, 2023, and June 30 of the immediately preceding fiscal year.
-- arguments: fiscal year; percent from June 30, 2008 to the preceding June 30; percent from June 30, 2008 to June 30, 2022; percent from June 30, 2023 to the preceding June 30.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2008 0 0 0 EQUALS JUST 190000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2009 0 0 0 EQUALS JUST 250000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2007 0 0 0 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2010 0 0 0 EQUALS JUST 250000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2014 4 0 0 EQUALS JUST 260000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2015 4 0 0 EQUALS JUST 310000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2023 10 10 0 EQUALS JUST 310000000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2024 0 10 3 EQUALS JUST 319300000
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(2) the amount the Secretary shall use for the fiscal year, in dollars` 2030 0 10 6 EQUALS JUST 328600000

§§ `(a)(3) funds availability`
-- src:3133 | (A) make the funds available for 2 fiscal years; and
-- funds of fiscal year 2020 are available in 2020 and 2021 ("for 2 fiscal years") and in no other.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(A) the funds are available in the fiscal year` 2020 2020 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(A) the funds are available in the fiscal year` 2020 2021 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(A) the funds are available in the fiscal year` 2020 2022 EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(A) the funds are available in the fiscal year` 2020 2019 EQUALS NOTHING
-- src:3134 | (B) allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year pursuant to such terms and conditions as are determined by the Secretary.
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(B) the State may carry the balance over to the next fiscal year` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(B) the State may carry the balance over to the next fiscal year` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(B) the State may carry the balance over to the next fiscal year` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(a)(3)(B) the State may carry the balance over to the next fiscal year` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `(b) basis for commodity purchases`
-- src:3135 | (b) Basis for commodity purchases
-- src:3136 | In purchasing commodities under subsection (a), the Secretary shall, to the extent practicable and appropriate, make purchases based on—
-- src:3137 | (1) agricultural market conditions;
-- src:3138 | (2) preferences and needs of States and distributing agencies; and
-- src:3139 | (3) preferences of recipients.
#ASSERT `s 2036(b) the purchases are based as the Secretary shall base them` TRUE (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 2036(b) the purchases are based as the Secretary shall base them` TRUE (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(b) the purchases are based as the Secretary shall base them` TRUE (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(b) the purchases are based as the Secretary shall base them` TRUE (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 2036(b) the purchases are based as the Secretary shall base them` FALSE (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `Regulative rules, run with #TRACE`
-- The stable binary does not let #ASSERT take a #TRACE outcome, so each trace states the outcome it should print.
-- src:3113 | (1) In general
-- src:3114 | From amounts made available to carry out this chapter, for each of the fiscal years 2014 through 2023, the Secretary shall purchase a dollar amount described in paragraph (2) of a variety of nutritious and useful commodities of the types that the Secretary has the authority to acquire through the Commodity Credit Corporation or under section 612c of this title and distribute the commodities to States for distribution in accordance with section 7515 of this title.
-- (a)(1): the Secretary purchases and distributes. Expected: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 2036(a)(1) the Secretary's duty to purchase commodities and distribute them to States` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Secretary` DOES `s 2036 purchase commodities and distribute them to States` AT 10
-- src:3133 | (A) make the funds available for 2 fiscal years; and
-- (a)(3)(A): the Secretary makes the funds available for 2 fiscal years. Expected: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 2036(a)(3)(A) the Secretary's duty to make the funds available for 2 fiscal years` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Secretary` DOES `s 2036 make the funds available for 2 fiscal years` AT 10
-- src:3134 | (B) allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year pursuant to such terms and conditions as are determined by the Secretary.
-- (a)(3)(B): the Secretary allows States to carry over. Expected: FULFILLED.
#TRACE `s 2036(a)(3)(B) the Secretary's duty to allow States to carry over unexpended balances` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Secretary` DOES `s 2036 allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year` AT 10

§§ `Every constructor and field declared in snap6-s2036.l4`
#ASSERT `s 2036 purchase commodities and distribute them to States` EQUALS `s 2036 purchase commodities and distribute them to States`
#ASSERT `s 2036 make the funds available for 2 fiscal years` EQUALS `s 2036 make the funds available for 2 fiscal years`
#ASSERT `s 2036 allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year` EQUALS `s 2036 allow States to carry over unexpended balances to the next fiscal year`
#ASSERT (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)'s `agricultural market conditions` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)'s `preferences and needs of States and distributing agencies` EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT (`s 2036 basis of purchases` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE)'s `preferences of recipients` EQUALS TRUE
